nce/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "a327107e917adda7c7748e617fca468d99eec5fb29bfa4fe429923a8398cafeb" "basis" 1193 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{{log}_{7}⁡x}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "a327107e917adda7c7748e617fca468d99eec5fb29bfa4fe429923a8398cafeb" "basis" 1193 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{7}⁡x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{log}_{7}⁡x}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int {log}_{7}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int u\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{2}\\int u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{2}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{4}\\cdot {log}_{7}^{2}⁡x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/state.json" "file_sha256" "a327107e917adda7c7748e617fca468d99eec5fb29bfa4fe429923a8398cafeb" "basis" 1193 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14028699/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/j