y" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/state.json" "file_sha256" "8ff5b367c94cd78e706b851ef08cb499a2e1131773e546cd468cb9ec4b0ff8c7"} {"question" "q-13837" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's set $u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives the following:\n\n| $x$ | $1$ | ${e}^{2}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $2$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{{e}^{2}}\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{2}{3}{\\int }_{1}^{{e}^{2}}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{2}u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot {\\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & ={\\frac{{u}^{2}}{3}|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{{2}^{2}}{3}-\\frac{{0}^{2}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/state.json" "file_sha256" "8ff5b367c94cd78e706b851ef08cb499a2e1131773e546cd468cb9ec4b0ff8c7"} {"question" "q-13837" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "cde6291e198ceef719653384d387bcbdaa20731b89884afdb61157cac76a2974"} {"question" "q-13837" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/state.json" "file_sha256" "8ff5b367c94cd78e706b851ef08cb499a2e1131773e546cd468cb9ec4b0ff8c7"} {"question" "q-13837" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{4}{3}"] ["math" "0"] ["math" "4"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{3}"] ["math" "\\frac{4}{3}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/state.json" "file_sha256" "8ff5b367c94cd78e706b851ef08cb499a2e1131773e546cd468cb9ec4b0ff8c7"} {"question" "q-13837" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{4}{3}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/state.json" "file_sha256" "8ff5b367c94cd78e706b851ef08cb499a2e1131773e546cd468cb9ec4b0ff8c7"} {"question" "q-31400" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{{log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/state.json" "file_sha256" "8ff5b367c94cd78e706b851ef08cb499a2e1131773e546cd468cb9ec4b0ff8c7"} {"question" "q-31400" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2}).$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{2}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\int u\\cdot (\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\int u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2{log}_{2}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{4}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/state.json" "file_sha256" "8ff5b367c94cd78e706b851ef08cb499a2e1131773e546cd468cb9ec4b0ff8c7"} {"question" "q-31400" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "cde6291e198ceef719653384d387bcbdaa20731b89884afdb61157cac76a2974"} {"question" "q-31400" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/state.json" "file_sha256" "8ff5b367c94cd78e706b851ef08cb499a2e1131773e546cd468cb9ec4b0ff8c7"} {"question" "q-31400" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2{log}_{2}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{2}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2{log}_{2}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2{log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{2}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2{log}_{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x{log}_{2}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{2}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/state.json" "file_sha256" "8ff5b367c94cd78e706b851ef08cb499a2e1131773e546cd468cb9ec4b0ff8c7"} {"question" "q-31400" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2{log}_{2}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})}{4}+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/state.json" "file_sha256" "8ff5b367c94cd78e706b851ef08cb499a2e1131773e546cd468cb9ec4b0ff8c7"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{{log}_{7}⁡x}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/state.json" "file_sha256" "8ff5b367c94cd78e706b851ef08cb499a2e1131773e546cd468cb9ec4b0ff8c7"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={log}_{7}⁡x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{log}_{7}⁡x}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int {log}_{7}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int u\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡7\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{2}\\int u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{2}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{4}\\cdot {log}_{7}^{2}⁡x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/state.json" "file_sha256" "8ff5b367c94cd78e706b851ef08cb499a2e1131773e546cd468cb9ec4b0ff8c7"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "cde6291e198ceef719653384d387bcbdaa20731b89884afdb61157cac76a2974"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14063295/state.json" "file_sha256" "8ff5b367c94cd78e706b851ef08cb499a2e1131773e546cd468cb9ec4b0ff8c7"} {"question" "q-114021" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "4\\cdot {log}_{7}^{2}⁡x+C"] ["math" 